Gladys MeteoSwiss — independent community integration.

Source of weather data: MeteoSwiss (MétéoSuisse).
Data terms: https://opendatadocs.meteoswiss.ch/
No proprietary MeteoSwiss graphics are included.

src/data/warning-regions.json contains geographic data from the official
MeteoSwiss hazard map, retrieved on 2026-10-10 (source URL in the file).
Only geographic coordinates, region identifiers and segment references are
retained; no website JavaScript is executed or redistributed.
Official warnings are read from the public MeteoSwiss hazard-map web product:
https://www.meteosuisse.admin.ch/services-et-publications/applications/dangers.html
Source: MeteoSwiss. The integration is independent of MeteoSwiss.

